{"ID":"20240515131435-tgbvlmc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131435-tgbvlmc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131435-tgbvlmc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133818-40v2080\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133818-40v2080\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:700,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133818-40v2080\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:517,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:517\u0026#125;","title":"030","type":"doc","updated":"20240515154026"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515133818-40v2080","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 950px;","id":"20240515133818-40v2080","updated":"20240515154026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2007/11/21"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CP"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"47歲，中等身材微胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/11"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初診時為Barrett's disease及鼻過敏。（目前鼻過敏已無發生）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本次就診為胃部時仍不適，偶而仍想吐，走路後若有打嗝則症狀緩解。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早上5:30會熱醒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"食道中間時痛，過去伴隨聲啞，現在聲音已好轉。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"時欲咳嗽。解尿時有時刺痛。稍說話即咽啞。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每日排便，大便呈淺咖啡色。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"會餓。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月經正常，但偶提前偶延後。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夜間睡時身溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"沈細小，無力。（寸上寸無附骨脈，咽喉無癌症。）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白紅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"穴位診→按壓太谿穴附近疼痛明顯。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎結石點按之疼痛。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"膀胱結石，胃家寒證，腎陽不足。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙腿腎結石點（阿是穴按痛點下針）。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右列缺、雙照海→治療咽痛，病患下針後食道中間痛感立去。（正列缺下針處位置位於脈診尺部後方，撥開脈後針於脈下。）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厚朴二錢 蘇葉二錢 夏枯草五錢 絡石藤三錢吳茱萸二錢 乾薑二錢 半夏三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豬苓三錢滑石四錢 澤瀉三錢 阿膠三錢（分三包，烊盡） 麻黃二錢炮"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附子三錢 細辛二錢 麥冬三錢 西洋參三錢   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先給粉劑100粒，8/13複診針灸時再給十帖湯劑"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Barrett's disease是遠端食道粘膜的鱗狀上皮被柱狀上皮所替代的病變。這種病變被認為是反逆性胃食道疾病的併發症，並因其會發展成食管癌而受到注意。本病大多數病人常會主訴胸骨後灼熱感、疼痛、消化不良、嘔吐物或糞便中帶血、吞咽固體食物困難，以及夜間熟睡時胃內容物逆流。病患之脈象為沈細小無力，此為腎脈，而「腎主喉嚨，腎病發於喉」，故產生上述食道痛症狀，而解尿時刺痛為腎結石症狀，師以針刺緩解疼痛，以處方治療。腎主雙腿，同時囑咐病患可藉運動護腎，加強下肢功能。方義：厚朴、蘇葉行氣，夏枯草、絡石藤治療咽喉食道腫脹，吳茱萸、乾薑溫中止嘔，豬苓湯利小便，麻黃附子細辛湯治少陰證（憑脈），麥冬、西洋參滋陰生津治咽啞。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}